ttps://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Errors in 4.4.1-stable \n- No errors in 4.3-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900H (20 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI just upgraded to 4.4.1 and am noticing errors regarding animation compression. \n\nI have animated characters in GLBs. I had a chicken already marked on the import settings to enable compression. When I open that scene it reports this many times:\n```\nERROR: Condition \"!compression.enabled\" is true. Returning: false\n   at: _get (scene/resources/animation.cpp:467)\n```\n\nThe animations work. If I reimport with compression turned off there are no errors.\n\nOn another creature, wolf.glb it did not have compression turned on. I did so and it processed the animations:\n```\nOriginal size: 91200 - Compressed size: 13724 15.05% pages: 2\nOriginal size: 268288 - Compressed size: 36344 13.55% pages: 5\nOriginal size: 91200 - Compressed size: 13092 14.36% pages: 2\nOriginal size: 91040 - Compressed size: 13960 15.33% pages: 2\nOriginal size: 91136 - Compressed size: 14032 15.4% pages: 2\nOriginal size: 131968 - Compressed size: 20464 15.51% pages: 3\nOriginal size: 364416 - Compressed size: 44532 12.22% pages: 6\nOriginal size: 261184 - Compressed size: 25884 9.91% pages: 4\nOriginal size: 257696 - Compressed size: 29268 11.36% pages: 4\nOriginal size: 1299168 - Compressed size: 138716 10.68% pages: 19\nOriginal size: 112864 - Compressed size: 18348 16.26% pages: 3\nOriginal size: 110560 - Compressed size: 18820 17.02% pages: 3\nOriginal size: 254784 - Compressed size: 17736 6.96% pages: 3\nOriginal size: 200928 - Compressed size: 28256 14.06% pages: 4\nOriginal size: 75360 - Compressed size: 11776 15.63% pages: 2\nOriginal size: 75360 - Compressed size: 11544 15.32% pages: 2\nOriginal size: 75360 - Compressed size: 11760 15.61% pages: 2\nOriginal size: 74240 - Compressed size: 12740 17.16% pages: 2\nOriginal size: 74272 - Compressed size: 12488 16.81% pages: 2\nOriginal size: 74816 - Compressed size: 12492 16.7% pages: 2\nOriginal size: 74752 - Compressed size: 12848 17.19% pages: 2\nOriginal size: 75328 - Compressed size: 11832 15.71% pages: 2\nOriginal size: 249920 - Compressed size: 14120 5.65% pages: 2\nOriginal size: 135296 - Compressed size: 18960 14.01% pages: 3\nOriginal size: 136000 - Compressed size: 19744 14.52% pages: 3\nOriginal size: 132576 - Compressed size: 20844 15.72% pages: 3\nOriginal size: 133408 - Compressed size: 19876 14.9% pages: 3\nOriginal size: 133056 - Compressed size: 20252 15.22% pages: 3\nOriginal size: 135072 - Compressed size: 19984 14.8% pages: 3\n```\n\nThen upon opening the scene it produced the same errors above, presumably 1 per animation. This seems to be the case for all of my animated meshes.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* Export a GLB with animations from blender, or use the Godot robot https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/blob/master/viewport/3d_in_2d/robot.glb\n* Import with AnimationPlayer / Compression / Enabled\n* Make a new inherited scene and open it\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSee above.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"http